href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Propositions 8.6.67–8.6.68; Definition 8.6.72"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"411–413"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; selected-source-pages-rendered; explicit-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-argument-expanded-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be44d5d262d8e4c8\" href=\"?note=be44d5d262d8e4c8\" title=\"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction\">56-df-edge-expanded-reduction</a> 的左线性系统。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Orthogonal}\">\\(\\operatorname{Orthogonal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e295b2b3159f2b40\" href=\"?note=e295b2b3159f2b40\" title=\"56-df-normal-form\">56-df-normal-form</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 同源；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(\\operatorname{src}(\\rho))\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wit}\">\\(\\operatorname{wit}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"001b6ab17e88507e\" href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a> 的相应系统实例。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T,Y\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\">\\(s\\in T,Y\\in\\operatorname{Exp}(s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(s)\">\\(z\\in\\operatorname{Vis}(s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(L,H)\\in R^e\\;(H\\notin\\mathcal V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(L,H)\\in R^e\\;(H\\notin\\mathcal V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V,R^e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V,R)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma^e,\\mathcal V,R^e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(L,H)\\in R^e\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(L):L|_q=x\\}|\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(L,H)\\in R^e\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathcal V\\;|\\{q\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(L):L|_q=x\\}|\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C(Y)=s,\\qquad\\operatorname{Rep}_Y(z)\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad|\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\mathcal E(s)}(z)|=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C(Y)=s,\\qquad\\operatorname{Rep}_Y(z)\\ne\\varnothing,\\qquad|\\operatorname{Rep}_{\\mathcal E(s)}(z)|=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}(T^e,\\to_{R^e},Y)\\iff\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NF}(T^e,\\to_{R^e},Y)\\iff\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\approx_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta)\\iff\\operatorname{wit}_{R^e}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))\\approx_{R^e}\\operatorname{wit}_{R^e}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\approx_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta)\\iff\\operatorname{wit}_{R^e}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\rho))\\approx_{R^e}\\operatorname{wit}_{R^e}(\\operatorname{EPath}_R(X,\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非collapsing与左线性由每条展开规则的构造直接成立。任何展开红项的根仍为原函数符号，e只出现在该根下面的边栈。一个非变量重叠塌缩后给出原左项间的非变量重叠；原系统正交排除了非平凡情形。来自同一原规则的不同边饱和不能在根统一：首个不同边栈在一侧出现e、另一侧出现原函数。故正交性保持。</p>\n<p>Y的每个原函数顶点前有非空e栈，每个变量叶前也有非空e栈。塌缩恢复s，并给出Rep非空和规范源唯一性。展开步骤塌缩为原步骤；反向原步骤由EStep唯一步提升。因此一侧存在红项当且仅当另一侧存在红项，得到正规形等价。</p>\n<p>置换方向逐个展开结构单位/结合/F及I/O生成式；同一展开源中的实际边栈确定展开规则侧，变量实例中的子证明项保持其边栈，故每个原生成实例提升成相应展开生成实例。反向删除e函数构造并把展开规则构造映回原规则构造，逐个塌缩同一组生成式。上下文同余与传递闭包保留此对应。这里只对普通路径见证断言；并未凭端点相同推断置换等价。</p>\n<p>原书命题8.6.68(iv)的证明正是展开和塌缩Table 8.2置换恒等式。以上对端点、正规形和位置代表的补充是所需实例的本地推导。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-edge-expanded-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"be44d5d262d8e4c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","exc